WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:16.236
that evening, Roxy and her friends went to Jack's backyard to play catch.

2
00:00:16.256 --> 00:00:21.617
"Seeing Rocket Girl this morning was so exciting," Terrell said.

3
00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:24.958
As he threw the ball to Roxy, he flashed a quick smile.

4
00:00:29.539 --> 00:00:32.020
wonder who that big pig was," Jack said.

5
00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:38.585
"He's obviously an evil villain—he was attacking Rocket Girl," Terrell said.

6
00:00:39.846 --> 00:00:41.127
Roxy threw the ball to Mara.

7
00:00:41.147 --> 00:00:45.751
"In my opinion he's not exactly evil."

8
00:00:47.153 --> 00:00:48.213
Jack raised an eyebrow.

9
00:00:48.233 --> 00:00:50.856
"How would you know, Roxy?

10
00:00:51.036 --> 00:00:52.417
You weren't even there."

11
00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:55.220
"Uh-oh," Roxy thought.

12
00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:59.584
"I told Roxy all about the pig," Terrell said quickly.

13
00:01:00.544 --> 00:01:03.366
"But he still seems like a villain to me."

14
00:01:03.386 --> 00:01:06.789
"Whew, saved by Terrell!"

15
00:01:07.129 --> 00:01:08.250
Roxy thought in relief.

16
00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:12.053
"Well, I think the pig is funny!"

17
00:01:12.493 --> 00:01:13.534
Mara said with a grin.

18
00:01:15.135 --> 00:01:16.156
Roxy's watch beeped.

19
00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:20.018
"I'll be right back—I have to call my mom," she said.

20
00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.362
Roxy hurried into Jack's front yard and opened her watch.

21
00:01:26.143 --> 00:01:27.304
Mayor Bloom looked upset.

22
00:01:28.428 --> 00:01:29.309
"What's wrong now?"

23
00:01:29.649 --> 00:01:30.329
Roxy asked.

24
00:01:30.349 --> 00:01:33.951
"We need help, Rocket Girl," the mayor said.

25
00:01:33.971 --> 00:01:37.453
"A monkey is destroying downtown Metro City!"

26
00:01:37.473 --> 00:01:40.875
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

27
00:01:40.895 --> 00:01:42.896
"I'm on my way."

28
00:01:44.977 --> 00:01:46.558
Roxy returned to Jack's backyard.

29
00:01:46.578 --> 00:01:50.801
"Hey, guys," she said, "I'll be back soon.

30
00:01:51.101 --> 00:01:52.522
I have to run home for something."

31
00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:56.264
As Roxy started to leave, Terrell hurried after her.

32
00:01:58.512 --> 00:02:01.653
"What's going on—is there a problem in Metro City?"

33
00:02:01.673 --> 00:02:04.795
"Sorry, Terrell, I can't tell you right now.

34
00:02:04.895 --> 00:02:05.675
I have to hurry."

35
00:02:06.355 --> 00:02:07.156
Roxy ran off.

36
00:02:07.176 --> 00:02:13.278
"Maybe I could have helped," Terrell mumbled as he kicked a pebble.

37
00:02:14.038 --> 00:02:15.679
Then he let out a frustrated sigh.

38
00:02:15.699 --> 00:02:19.661
"I wish I had super powers."

39
00:02:24.623 --> 00:02:27.824
When Roxy arrived downtown, she saw people running in every direction.

40
00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.222
"That monkey is crazy!"

41
00:02:33.082 --> 00:02:34.283
"Run for your lives!"

42
00:02:36.585 --> 00:02:40.648
"Rocket Girl," a man cried, "you're here—what a relief!"

43
00:02:42.089 --> 00:02:43.229
"Where's the monkey?"

44
00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:44.230
Roxy asked.

45
00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:48.313
"He's standing in the intersection," the man said, pointing.

46
00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:51.075
"He keeps yelling at cars and attacking them.

47
00:02:51.776 --> 00:02:54.798
He thinks everyone is trying to hit him."

48
00:02:55.378 --> 00:02:56.579
"Why does he think that?"

49
00:02:57.039 --> 00:02:57.760
Roxy asked.

50
00:02:59.128 --> 00:03:01.590
"I have no idea," the man replied with a shrug.

51
00:03:03.912 --> 00:03:05.252
Roxy flew to the intersection.

52
00:03:06.333 --> 00:03:09.335
Smoke filled the air, and smashed cars lined the streets.

53
00:03:10.576 --> 00:03:13.058
She spotted Detective Smith crouching behind a police car.

54
00:03:16.861 --> 00:03:22.605
Detective," Roxy said, "you really shouldn't let your pet monkey destroy stuff like that."

55
00:03:22.625 --> 00:03:25.947
"Ha-ha, Rocket Girl."

56
00:03:26.247 --> 00:03:27.228
The detective frowned.

57
00:03:27.988 --> 00:03:30.210
"It's not a pet monkey who's doing all the destruction.

58
00:03:31.171 --> 00:03:34.734
It's a talking monkey, kind of like that pig, Bajie."

59
00:03:36.135 --> 00:03:38.297
Smash! Crash!

60
00:03:38.837 --> 00:03:40.158
A car flew through the air.

61
00:03:40.178 --> 00:03:42.200
"Oh no!"

62
00:03:42.641 --> 00:03:44.522
Roxy flew fast and caught the car.

63
00:03:45.543 --> 00:03:49.006
As she put it down on the street, another car went tumbling through the air.

64
00:03:50.567 --> 00:03:51.408
Roxy gasped.

65
00:03:52.529 --> 00:03:53.890
The driver was still inside!

66
00:03:55.511 --> 00:03:59.869
Bang! The car hit the side of the building and fell toward the concrete sidewalk.

67
00:03:59.889 --> 00:04:02.190
"Help, Rocket Girl!"

68
00:04:02.551 --> 00:04:03.431
the driver yelled.

69
00:04:05.032 --> 00:04:07.292
Roxy caught the car just before it reached the ground.

70
00:04:08.633 --> 00:04:09.753
She put it down carefully.

71
00:04:13.495 --> 00:04:15.476
The driver stepped out and wiped his forehead.

72
00:04:15.496 --> 00:04:17.156
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

73
00:04:18.537 --> 00:04:21.718
Just then a large bus zoomed around a corner and into the intersection.

74
00:04:22.999 --> 00:04:25.540
The monkey raised the iron bar and faced the bus.

75
00:04:26.961 --> 00:04:28.886
"Stop trying to attack me!"
